{"title":"1608.08028 From Deterministic ODEs to Dynamic Structural Causal Models","markdown":{"headingText":"1608.08028 From Deterministic ODEs to Dynamic Structural Causal Models","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Paul K. Rubenstein, Stephan Bongers, Bernhard Schölkopf, Joris M. Mooij / 2016-08-29（v2 2018-07-09）/ arXiv:1608.08028\n- **一句话定位**：证明在\"结构动态稳定\"条件下，常微分方程组（ODE）在时变干预下的渐近行为可以用动态结构因果模型（Dynamic SCM, DSCM）来刻画，从而把 Mooij et al. (2013) 从\"静态平衡 + 常数干预\"推广到\"渐近动态（如周期振荡）+ 依时变化的干预\"。\n- **研究问题**：SCM 常由 ODE 的平衡态导出，但既有结果要求系统收敛到与初始条件无关的唯一静态平衡，且只能建模把变量钳制为常数的干预；对受迫阻尼谐振子等简单系统这两个假设都不成立。能否对不收敛到平衡的系统（如周期运动）仍从 ODE 严格导出可推理干预效应的 SCM？\n- **模型与方法**：ODE D 由 D 个方程 f_i(X_i, X_{pa(i)})(t)=0（含直到 n_i 阶导数）及初始条件构成，第 i 个方程被视为决定 X_i 动力学的因果机制，泛函依赖图为因果图。时变完美干预 do(X_I=ζ_I)：把被干预变量的方程替换为 X_i(t)−ζ_i(t)=0。轨迹集 Dyn=∪_I Dyn_I 需满足模块性（modularity，Definition 1：单变量轨迹可任意拼成联合轨迹），例如全体常数轨迹（退化为 Mooij et al. 2013）、渐近不同的 C¹ 轨迹或全体周期运动。DSCM（Definition 4）是取值于轨迹空间的结构方程组 M: X_i=F_i(X_{pa(i)})，i∈I，其中 F_i 把父变量的整条轨迹映射为子变量的渐近轨迹。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Definition 2/3 定义（相对 Dyn_I 的）动态稳定性：对任意干预与初始条件，解 X_I(t)→η(t)∈Dyn_I。Definition 5（结构动态稳定性）要求 (D, Dyn_{I\\{i}}) 对所有 i 动态稳定，即干预除一个变量外的全部变量后剩余变量的渐近轨迹仍唯一落于 Dyn 中——这是构造结构方程的关键。Theorem 1：若 (D, Dyn) 结构动态稳定，则按\"对 D−1 个变量干预、读出唯一渐近轨迹\"构造的 F_i: Dyn_{pa(i)}→Dyn_{pa(i)}→Dyn_i 良定义，得到导出 DSCM M_D。Theorem 3 与 Corollary 1（在 Section 5.4，另含解的唯一性 Theorem 2）：M_{D_do(X_I=ζ_I)}=(M_D)_do(X_I=ζ_I)，即\"先在 ODE 上干预再导出 DSCM\"与\"先导出 DSCM 再干预\"结果一致（图 3 的交换图），故 DSCM 可忠实推理 ODE 在 Dyn 内任意干预下的渐近动力学。Example 4 给出双质量-弹簧系统的显式 DSCM：Dyn 取绝对收敛余弦级数轨迹，结构方程把每个质量的渐近振荡写成另一质量振荡的泛函（式 2–3）；作者指出连该简单例的 DSCM 已相当复杂，参数的数据驱动估计留作 future work。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：属于\"SCM 由更基础的物理模型导出\"这一理论纲领（Iwasaki–Simon、Dash、Mooij et al. 2013、Bongers–Mooij 2018 的延长线），首次把可导出 SCM 的系统类从平衡态系统扩到周期等动态平稳系统，为振荡系统（EEG、昼夜节律、化学振荡、电路）的因果分析奠定理论基础；与 Dynamic Bayesian Networks 的区别在于后者依赖离散时间马尔可夫假设。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1608.08028.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution